@startuml
title BrewLite — Task 3.2: UML deployment diagram\nCấu hình repo · trạng thái live chưa xác minh
top to bottom direction
skinparam defaultFontName DejaVu Sans
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam nodesep 30
skinparam ranksep 35
skinparam ArrowColor #365569
skinparam nodeBorderColor #587387
skinparam packageBorderColor #587387

frame "LOCAL · máy phát triển" as Local #F2F6FA {
  node "[DEP-LOCAL] Docker Engine / Compose" as Docker <<executionEnvironment>> {
    artifact "Web :3000 · API :4000\nPostgreSQL :5432 (host :5433)\npostgres_data: volume bền vững local\n.env từ .env.example" as LocalStack
  }
}

frame "CI / RELEASE · GitHub" as CICD #F3F7EE {
  node "[DEP-CI] TuanEm2/Assignment2\nGitHub Actions runner" as Runner <<executionEnvironment>> {
    artifact "ci.yml: lint / test / build\ncd.yml: quality gate → image SHA\n→ deploy API / Web → smoke HTTPS" as Workflow
  }
  node "[DEP-REG] GHCR · container registry" as Registry {
    artifact "ghcr.io/tuanem2/\nassignment2-api:<SHA>\nassignment2-web:<SHA>" as Images
  }
  Runner ..> Registry : push images\nHTTPS 443
}

node "[DEP-USER] Thiết bị người dùng" as Device {
  node "Trình duyệt desktop / mobile" as Browser <<executionEnvironment>> {
    artifact "UI BrewLite\nPWA: chưa cấu hình" as UI
  }
}

frame "PRODUCTION · Render · theo cấu hình repo" as Production #EDF5FA {
  node "[DEP-EDGE] Render edge / TLS\nPublic Web / API origins" as Edge <<executionEnvironment>>
  node "[DEP-WEB] Web Service · frontend" as Web <<executionEnvironment>> {
    artifact "Next.js / Node.js\nassignment2-web:<SHA>\nPORT: image mặc định 3000" as Next
  }
  node "[DEP-API] Web Service · API" as API <<executionEnvironment>> {
    artifact "NestJS / Node.js\nassignment2-api:<SHA>\nPORT: source fallback 4000\nMock payment trong PaymentsModule" as Nest
  }
  node "[DEP-DB] Managed PostgreSQL" as DBService <<executionEnvironment>> {
    database "BrewLite · TCP 5432\nPersistent database storage" as DB
  }
  Edge --> Web : HTTP :PORT
  Edge --> API : HTTP :PORT
  API --> DB : PostgreSQL TCP 5432\nInternal DATABASE_URL
  Web -[hidden]right-> API
}

Local -[hidden]right-> CICD
Browser --> Edge : HTTPS 443\nTải UI và gọi REST /api/*
Runner ..> Production : Render API · HTTPS 443\nDeploy đúng SHA, API trước Web
Registry ..> Web : Render pull image\nHTTPS 443
Registry ..> API : Render pull image\nHTTPS 443

legend bottom
  |= Hạng mục |= Cấu hình trong repo |
  | Runtime API | DATABASE_URL · JWT_SECRET · CORS_ORIGINS · PAYMENT_MODE |
  | Build Web | NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL: public HTTPS API, cần rebuild khi đổi |
  | Release | RENDER_API_KEY, service IDs; pre-deploy API: npm run db:migrate* |
  | Health / log | /api/health: liveness; stdout/stderr, GitHub/Render deploy logs |
  | Ranh giới | Local volume và CI runner tách biệt PostgreSQL production |
  | Bằng chứng | Chưa xác minh domain, region, PORT, plan hoặc trạng thái live |
  | Ký hiệu | Nét liền: runtime; nét đứt: build/deploy; node + artifact: UML |
endlegend
caption * Pre-deploy cần cấu hình và gói Render hỗ trợ.\nAssignment2 @ 9715b33 · kiểm tra 16/11/2026 · nguồn: Compose, Dockerfiles, CI/CD, env example
@enduml
